      "description_fr": "Peu de monstres, mais chacun est une menace. Focus et coordination requis.",
      "description_en": "Few monsters, but each is a threat. Focus and coordination required.",
      "strategy": "Single-target burst, interrupt healers, coordinate focus fire"
